# This project deploys to a Linux device (Raspberry Pi) even when developed on
# Windows. Force LF line endings for anything that gets executed as a shell
# script or read by systemd/udev on the Pi, regardless of the checking-out
# platform's core.autocrlf setting - a CRLF shell script fails outright on
# Linux ("$'\r': command not found"), it's not just cosmetic.
*.sh text eol=lf
.envrc text eol=lf
install/inkypi text eol=lf
install/inkypi.service text eol=lf
install/cli/inkypi-plugin text eol=lf
